<title>POLAND: Polish minimum T-bill prices down at tender.</title>
<headline>Polish minimum T-bill prices down at tender.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills fell at Monday's primary auction on total demand of 881 million zlotys against a 1.3 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>The ministry sold T-bills worth 703 million zlotys at the tender.</p>
<p>The ministry also said that at its next primary T-bill tender on Wednesday, June 25, it would offer 600 million zlotys of 52-week T-bills.</p>
<p>The value date for the next tender is Friday, June 27.</p>
